00:46:45.400 --> 00:46:49.900
But a key ingredient is this.

00:46:52.500 --> 00:46:53.460
The slope

00:46:53.460 --> 00:47:04.500
has

00:47:04.500 --> 00:47:05.920
this cool formula,

00:47:05.920 --> 00:47:08.220
which is again derived in the
